 </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ALLOW\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;claim_id&quot;: &quot;gc-2026-0443&quot;,&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: &quot;EU&quot;,&#10;  &quot;claim_text_zh&quot;: &quot;环保之选，为地球尽一份力&quot;,&#10;  &quot;claim_text_local&quot;: &quot;The eco-friendly choice&quot;,&#10;  &quot;classification&quot;: &quot;generic&quot;,&#10;  &quot;specificity&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;self_contained_on_same_medium&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;qualifier_present&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;vague_terms_detected&quot;: [&quot;eco-friendly&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;substantiation&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;recognised_excellence_ref&quot;: null&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;label_elements&quot;: [{ &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;self_designed_badge&quot;, &quot;cert_scheme_id&quot;: null }],&#10;  &quot;verdict&quot;: &quot;BLOCK&quot;,&#10;  &quot;block_code&quot;: &quot;GENERIC_ENVIRONMENTAL_CLAIM_NO_RECOGNISED_EXCELLENCE&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"claim_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gc-2026-0443\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"claim_text_zh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"环保之选，为地球尽一份力\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"claim_text_local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"The eco-friendly choice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"classification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"generic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"specificity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"self_contained_on_same_medium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"qualifier_present\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"vague_terms_detected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eco-friendly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"substantiation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"recognised_excellence_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"label_elements\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"self_designed_badge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cert_scheme_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"verdict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BLOCK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"block_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GENERIC_ENVIRONMENTAL_CLAIM_NO_RECOGNISED_EXCELLENCE\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两条判定的差别只在两个字段：<code>classification</code> 与 <code>recognised_excellence_ref</code>。把黑名单做成「泛泛宣称 + 无认可证明 → 阻断」这一条规则，就能覆盖指令新增的多数情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视觉元素与隐含暗示\">视觉元素与隐含暗示</h2><p>文本判定之外，视觉线索也是判定输入。可自动化的部分有限，但可以做两级筛选：第一级是关键词命中环境类词表，第二级是视觉标签检测（是否存在未注册认证 ID 的徽章元素）。两级同时命中时，素材在发布前必须人工确认，且确认记录要留存——这是 <a href=\"../claim-rule-engine-gate/campaign-prepublish-gate\">活动/素材发布前合规闸</a> 里复核队列的一类典型条目。</p>\n<p>注意「隐含暗示」的判定不能只用图像识别，颜色、版式、背景图案都可能构成暗示。工程上更可靠的做法是把素材模板作为受控资产：模板由合规侧审核一次，之后的素材变体继承模板的判定结论，只有偏离模板的部分才需要重新判定。这能把复核量从「每条素材」降到「每个模板」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Directive (EU) 2024/825 把未展示公认卓越环保绩效的泛泛环境宣称列为任何情况下都不公平的商业行为，成员国自 <strong>2026 年 9 月 27 日</strong>起适用（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32024L0825\">同前</a>）；当下即是适用期。</li>\n<li>具体化的判据是「同一媒介上以清晰显著方式提供说明」：包装上的泛泛宣称不能用网页上的说明来救；书面或口头宣称结合颜色、图像的隐含暗示也可能构成泛泛宣称。</li>\n<li>认可卓越绩效的证明路径包括 EU Ecolabel（Regulation (EC) No 66/2010）与官方认可的 EN ISO 14024 体系；自造绿色徽章不满足标签门槛，直接阻断。</li>\n<li>碳中和宣称须绑定核算范围、唯一且未重复使用的抵消凭证、以及减排发生的时间；把两年后才会发生的减排表述为已发生是欺骗性的（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/260.5\">16 CFR § 260.5</a>）。</li>\n<li>可回收、再生含量、可降解等宣称必须给出限定范围与条件，泛泛的全面环保益处宣称难以被充分证实（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/260.4\">16 CFR § 260.4</a>）。</li>\n<li>视觉与隐含暗示难以全自动判定，可控做法是把素材模板作为受控资产，一次审核、变体继承，把复核量从每条素材降到每个模板。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"绿色/环保宣称与反洗白","id":"绿色-环保宣称与反洗白"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"具体化的判定标准","id":"具体化的判定标准"},{"level":3,"text":"标签与认证的门槛","id":"标签与认证的门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"碳中和与可回收这两个子类","id":"碳中和与可回收这两个子类"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉元素与隐含暗示","id":"视觉元素与隐含暗示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"功效/健康/金融宣称限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/advertising-claim-rule/efficacy-health-finance-claim"},"next":{"title":"违禁/夸大宣称词库与规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-claim-promo-compliance/claim-rule-engine-gate/forbidden-claim-word-rule"}}